          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "la ligne d'arrivée joins ligne, from Latin līnea \"a line\", and arrivée, built on arriver, from Vulgar Latin arrīpāre \"to come to the shore\", built on rīpa \"bank\" (Lewis & Short)."
